\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ProoVer 2026 proof \texttt {PRV000+1.s} (comments and SZS delimiters omitted). Axiom and conjecture are imported from the problem file, \texttt {neg} negates the conjecture, and one \texttt {consequence} step derives \texttt {\$false} from \texttt {neg} and \texttt {a1}.}}{5}{figure.1}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Expected score of accepting, rejecting, and abstaining as a function of the probability $p$ that the proof is valid, under the ProoVer 2026 scoring scheme. Accepting beats abstaining only for $p>10/11$, rejecting only for $p<2/3$.}}{12}{figure.2}%
